					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700781602,
					"content": "现在看来什么都没有嘛…没有深渊魔物，也没有什么幽灵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700781603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700781603,
					"content": "甚至感觉有点寂寞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700781604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700781604,
					"content": "…寂寞才是最可怕的魔鬼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700781605
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700781605,
					"content": "哦，是嘛，完全听不懂！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700781606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700781606,
					"content": "不过刚才还猛吹的风到底是哪里…咦，不对，是在上面！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700781607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700781607,
					"content": "有什么从上面掉下来了，噫——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
